@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Announcement}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Usage}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Announcement @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Usage</PageTitle>

<h1>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Announcement @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Usage</h1>

<p>
    The majority of the Announcement History dialogs parameter are for the text that appears for the heading and buttons. The only noteworthy parameters are
    "TriggerText" which is the text that appears on the separate tiggering button (shown bottom right on each page) and the "TriggerVisible" parameter that
    determines if this button is visible whilst not in focus.
</p>
<p>
    All parameters have default values. The following examples shows all of the parameters being supplied with the default values.
</p>

<CodeBox CodeBlock="@AnnouncementHistorySnippets.Add_Configure_Announcement_History_Component" AriaLabel="Announcement History code block" />

<p>
    The announcement history will display the following information as a single string entry separated by semi-colons for each
    list item in its list, starting with the most recent announcement:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>
        The elapsed time since the announcement was made.
    </li>
    <li>The page title of the page where the announcement was made; blank if there was no page title.</li>
    <li>The triggering element such as "Save Customer Button"; blank if the information was not provided.</li>
    <li>The message provided.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    The page title and triggering element provide context for the user, so please ensure that your pages have titles (also needed for WCAG) and that you
    provide the name of the triggering element such as "Save Customer Button".
</p>

<ThemeBorderTool Title="Applicable theme border tools" ThemeToolHeadingLevel="ThemeToolHeadingLevel.H2">
    <BorderGroups>
        <BorderGroup Title="Dialog borders">
            <BorderRadius LabelText="Outer radius" ResetText="Reset outer radius" MaxRangeValue="@GlobalValues.Radius_Dialog_Surface_Max_Range_Value" CssProperties="@([new(CoreCssVariables.Group_Dialog_Radius_Surface), new(CoreCssVariables.Group_Dialog_Radius_Base)])" />
            <BorderRadius LabelText="Inner radius" ResetText="Reset inner radius" MaxRangeValue="@GlobalValues.Radius_Dialog_Content_Max_Range_Value" CssProperties="@([new(CoreCssVariables.Group_Dialog_Radius_Content)])" />
        </BorderGroup>
        <BorderGroup Title="Button/link borders">
            <BorderRadius LabelText="Button radius" ResetText="Reset button radius" MaxRangeValue="@GlobalValues.Radius_Button_Max_Range_Value" CssProperties="@([new(CoreCssVariables.Group_Button_Radius)])" />
        </BorderGroup>
        <BorderGroup Title="Revealed borders">
            <BorderRadius LabelText="Revealed radius" ResetText="Reset revealed radius" MaxRangeValue="@GlobalValues.Radius_Reveal_Max_Range_Value" CssProperties="@([new(CoreCssVariables.Group_Revealed_Radius_Surface)])" />
        </BorderGroup>
    </BorderGroups>
</ThemeBorderTool>

<div class="@FlexContent.Base @FlexContent.Wrap(UnitFlexWrap.Wrap) @LayoutAlignment.JustifyContent(UnitJustifyContent.SpaceBetween) @LayoutAlignment.AlignItems(UnitAlignItems.Centre)">
        <a class="@Button.Base @Button.LinkStyle @Gap.SetColGap(UnitGapSize.Four)" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Announcement}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Api}")">
        <span class="@SvgIcon.Base @SvgIcon.Size(UnitIconSize.ExtraLarge)" aria-hidden="true" style="--_svg-icon-source:var(--svg-left-arrow-circle-icon)"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Announcement - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Api</span>

    </a>
        <a class="@Button.Base @Button.LinkStyle @Gap.SetColGap(UnitGapSize.Four)" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Busy}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview}")">

        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Busy - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</span>
        <span class="@SvgIcon.Base @SvgIcon.Size(UnitIconSize.ExtraLarge)" aria-hidden="true" style="--_svg-icon-source:var(--svg-right-arrow-circle-icon)"></span>
    </a>
</div>
